==============================================================================
Product Actualizer: https://github.com/SPRIME01/Product-Actualizer

License: Apache-2.0 (owner relicense, 2026-10-19)
Source commit: c9df8d2
Borrowed (vocabulary and structure only; no imported code):

  - Structural vocabulary at T04: deterministic source references, a closed
    surface model, persistent navigation context, and pure projection from
    typed state. Horizon's implementation is an independent TypeScript
    derivation; no donor file was copied verbatim.

  - Surface vocabulary as data at T05: responsibility names, intent names,
    layout-placement names and tone names, transcribed into
    src/ui/surface2/grammar.ts (RESPONSIBILITIES, SURFACE_INTENTS,
    LAYOUT_PLACEMENTS, TONES). These are data, not donor code. Horizon validates
    them with its own schemas.

Not borrowed: Product Actualizer's Product Model, router, approval engine,
reducer, server process, second authoritative state store, or its
loopback/local-token trust model.

